  "solution": {
    "text": "For equilibrium, the total upward pull will be equal to the downward pull. If V is the volume of the sphere, we have<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi>V</mi><mo>⁡</mo> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi>V</mi><mo>⁡</mo> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mi>V</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mi>ρ</mi> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mi>ρ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>6</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <msup> <mtext>g cm</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <msup> <mtext>g cm</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math>",
